# Troubleshooting

Welcome to the Codexeron Troubleshooting Guide.

This section helps users identify and resolve common issues when using the Codexeron Marketplace.

---

# General Troubleshooting

Before contacting support:

- Check your account status.
- Verify your internet connection.
- Review the related documentation.
- Make sure you are using the correct account.

---

# Account Issues

## I cannot access my account

Check:

- Email address accuracy.
- Password information.
- Email verification status.

If the problem continues, contact Codexeron support.

---

## I forgot my password

Use the account recovery options available on the Codexeron website.

Never share your password with anyone.

---

# Purchase Issues

## My purchase is not visible

Check:

- Payment status.
- Order history.
- Account information.

If your payment was completed but the order is missing, contact support.

---

## My payment is pending

Payment confirmation may take time depending on transaction conditions.

Verify:

- Transaction details.
- Payment information.
- Network status.

---

# Download Issues

## I cannot download my purchased product

Check:

- Your purchase status.
- License availability.
- Account access.

Make sure you are logged into the account used during purchase.

---

## Download link is unavailable

Possible reasons:

- Payment is not completed.
- Product access is restricted.
- License conditions do not allow access.

---

# License Issues

## My license is not visible

Check:

- Purchase completion.
- Account information.
- Product availability.

If the issue continues, contact support.

---

## License validation failed

Check:

- License information.
- Product version.
- Installation requirements.

---

# Product Issues

## A purchased product is not working

Before contacting support:

- Review installation documentation.
- Check system requirements.
- Verify compatibility.
- Check available updates.

---

# Security Issues

If you discover suspicious activity:

- Secure your account.
- Change your password.
- Avoid sharing sensitive information.
- Report the issue through official support channels.

---

# Contact Support

When requesting help, provide:

- Account information.
- Product name.
- Order details.
- Problem description.
- Error messages.
- Relevant screenshots.

Detailed information helps resolve issues faster.

---

# More Information

For detailed guides and current policies, visit:

https://www.codexeron.com

